<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<Report xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <name>케이스 발생 현황 (거래처별)</name>
    <reportType>CaseList</reportType>
    <format>Summary</format>
    <scope>organization</scope>
    <description>거래처·우선순위별 케이스 발생 건수를 집계해 반복 장애 고객을 식별한다. 교체·PM 우선순위 결정에 활용한다.</description>
    <showDetails>false</showDetails>
    <showGrandTotal>true</showGrandTotal>
    <showSubTotals>true</showSubTotals>
    <columns>
        <field>CASE_NUMBER</field>
    </columns>
    <columns>
        <field>STATUS</field>
    </columns>
    <groupingsDown>
        <field>OWNER</field>
        <dateGranularity>None</dateGranularity>
        <sortOrder>Asc</sortOrder>
    </groupingsDown>
    <groupingsDown>
        <field>PRIORITY</field>
        <dateGranularity>None</dateGranularity>
        <sortOrder>Asc</sortOrder>
    </groupingsDown>
    <timeFrameFilter>
        <dateColumn>CREATED_DATE</dateColumn>
        <interval>INTERVAL_CURY</interval>
    </timeFrameFilter>
    <chart>
        <chartType>HorizontalBar</chartType>
        <groupingColumn>OWNER</groupingColumn>
        <chartSummaries>
            <column>RowCount</column>
        </chartSummaries>
        <enableHoverLabels>true</enableHoverLabels>
        <location>CHART_TOP</location>
        <size>Medium</size>
        <title>거래처별 케이스 발생 건수 (올해)</title>
    </chart>
</Report>
